WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
PMM monitoring is already in place. Next is the failover test.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Failover asks for confirmation, because it deliberately takes down the primary.

3
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:15.000
The test starts, after checking that no other platform operation is running.

4
00:00:15.000 --> 00:01:15.000
In the Kubernetes Monitor, CloudNativePG reports the primary as unhealthy and fails over from platform-postgres-1. Probes fail while that pod restarts.

5
00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:27.000
The log confirms the starting state: three instances, platform-postgres-1 as primary, and PostgreSQL reachable before the failure.

6
00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:36.000
After the failure, CloudNativePG promotes platform-postgres-2. It is ready and accepting connections.

7
00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:51.000
HA test passed. The whole failover test took 1 minute 18 seconds.

